  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CA02310",
    "sub_id": "43140",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>每次上課點名，請踴躍參與課堂討論。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "課堂中請踴躍參與討論與發言，邀請校外講者（校內、外校師長或業界專家等）演講請多多提問，視表現評分。口頭報告請務必依排定時間準時出席報告。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please actively participate in class discussions and speak up. When guest speakers are invited (including faculty members from within and outside the university, or industry experts), feel free to ask questions. Participation and performance will be factored into your grade. For oral presentations, make sure to attend and present on time according to the scheduled time.",
    "course_rem": "上課請踴躍參與討論與發言。有任何課程相關問題請及早提出或詢問。",
    "course_rem_en": "Please actively engage in discussions and share your thoughts during class. If you have any questions related to the course, please ask them early.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>\n<div>遵守學術誠信原則：</div>\n\n<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>嚴禁抄襲：請勿抄襲他人作業、論文或報告，引用他人觀點時務必標明來源。</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>資料真實：提交之資料和研究結果必須真實，不得偽造或篡改。</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>獨立完成作業：除明確允許合作外，所有作業應獨立完成，避免代寫或代做</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>本課程鼓勵課堂討論與發言。在口頭報告時，請先整理並分析所收集的資料，以清晰有條理的方式表達，並多分享自己的觀點與結論。請避免抄襲（特別是來自網絡的資源），並尊重他人的智慧財產權。</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div><strong>Academic Integrity Statements:</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>No plagiarism:</strong> Do not copy others&rsquo; work; always cite sources when referencing ideas.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Accuracy of data:</strong> Submit truthful and unaltered data and research results.</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>Independent work:</strong> Unless collaboration is allowed, complete assignments independently.</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>This course encourages class discussions. For oral reports, organize and present your findings clearly, and share your own conclusions. Avoid plagiarism and respect intellectual property rights.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
